// M365 Full Access Granted on a Mailbox
// Detects FullAccess delegation being added to a mailbox, which lets another account read everything in it without the owner's credentials.
// techniques: T1098.002   severity: medium   status: experimental
// validate: Atomic Red Team T1098.002
//   Add-MailboxPermission -Identity <lab-user> -User <other-user> -AccessRights FullAccess
// source: rules/persistence/m365-mailbox-full-access-granted.yml  (GENERATED, do not edit by hand)
OfficeActivity
| where ((Operation =~ @"Add-MailboxPermission") and (Parameters contains @"FullAccess"))
